      "tech": "Deep learning and computer vision AI related technologies will be used, and Gen AI will be added to provide further information generation.",
      "benefit": "AISVision\nSolve pain points\n1. Manual visual inspection is inefficient and prone to misjudgment due to fatigue.\n2. There are many types of production line defects and inconsistent standards, making it difficult to quantify\nMain benefits\n1. Consistent and stable judgment standards: avoid human subjective errors\n2. Rapid model training and deployment: shortening the time for new product introduction and testing\n3. Quality data traceability: supports quality analysis and continuous improvement\n4. Reduce labor costs and improve yield rate\n\nDetector\nSolve pain points\n1. The test signals (vibration, current, temperature, acoustics, etc.) have a large amount of data and are difficult to interpret in real time manually.\n2. There is a lot of noise in the signal, and abnormal features are difficult to identify.\nMain benefits\nAutomatic identification of abnormal signals: Find the real abnormal pattern from the noise\nEarly detection of potential problems: early warning before failure or quality abnormality\nReduce misjudgments and missed judgments: smarter judgment than fixed thresholds\n\nSODA\nSolve pain points\n1. Scheduling relies on manual labor and experience, and adjustments are time-consuming and error-prone.\n2. It is difficult to balance multiple machines, multiple work orders, and multiple restrictions (delivery, manpower, equipment)\n3. Order insertion, delays, and equipment abnormalities cause the original schedule to frequently fail.\n4. Unable to quickly simulate the impact of different scheduling solutions on production capacity and delivery time\nMain benefits\n1. Intelligent production scheduling: automatically consider delivery time, production capacity, and constraints\n2. Real-time rearrangement capability: quick adjustment in response to orders or abnormalities\n3. Improve on-time delivery rate (OTD): effectively reduce delays and traffic jams\n4. Improve equipment and manpower utilization\n5. Scenario simulation and decision support: assist managers in choosing the best scheduling solution\n\n\nPHM\nSolve pain points\n1. Equipment failure cannot be predicted and can only be repaired passively.\n2. Unplanned shutdowns cause significant production capacity losses\n3. Over-maintenance or under-maintenance, cost imbalance\n4. Experience relies on senior personnel, and knowledge is difficult to pass on\nMain benefits\n1. Equipment health monitoring: grasp the operating status in real time\n2. Predictive Maintenance: plan maintenance in advance\n3. Reduce the risk of downtime: Improve equipment availability (OEE)\n4. Digitization of knowledge: reducing reliance on personal experience\n\nSmart City\nMain benefits\nUse Gen AI to assist customized needs",
